title: "Cyclic Graph Index Prediction Benchmark"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Iqbal"
    given-names: "Mansoor"

repository-code: "https://github.com/iqbalmansoor1986-hue/Cyclic-Graph-Index-Prediction-Benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/iqbalmansoor1986-hue/Cyclic-Graph-Index-Prediction-Benchmark"

version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-23"

abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational benchmark for exact topological-index
  labeling and machine-learning-based surrogate prediction across
  unicyclic, bicyclic, circulant, and larger sparse-multicyclic graph
  families. The repository includes controlled graph generation,
  structure-preserving transformations, exact computation of six
  classical topological indices, descriptor-based regression, graph
  neural network models, transferability experiments, stress testing,
  and graph-level and parent-aware data-partitioning protocols.

keywords:
  - "topological indices"
  - "unicyclic graphs"
  - "bicyclic graphs"
  - "circulant graphs"
  - "multicyclic graphs"
  - "graph neural networks"
  - "graph regression"
  - "graph isomorphism"
  - "parent-aware splitting"
  - "machine learning"
  - "surrogate modeling"
  - "computational graph theory"

